---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-8 border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 text-slate-200">
  <div class="site-container grid gap-8 py-12 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">電訊格價通</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        中立比較香港手機月費同家居寬頻，幫你揀到啱用又抵用嘅 Plan。資料每月更新。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">熱門比較</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/mobile-plan/')}>香港 5G 月費比較</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/mobile-plan/cmhk/')}>中國移動香港月費</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/broadband/')}>家居寬頻格價</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/guides/mnp-transfer/')}>攜號轉台（MNP）全攻略</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">場景專頁</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/mobile-plan/gba-roaming/')}>大灣區一卡兩號</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/mobile-plan/student/')}>學生 Plan</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/mobile-plan/cheap-4g/')}>平價 4.5G</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={withBase('/broadband/estate/public-housing/')}>公屋寬頻</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="site-container flex flex-col gap-2 py-4 text-xs text-slate-500 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} 電訊格價通。本站為獨立格價資訊平台，與各電訊商無附屬關係。</p>
      <p>實際月費以電訊商最終確認為準。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
